{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops-2603-0019","content_id":"4b59e9b4-cfe1-4b4f-92f7-92ac1eebd937","description":"Product Recall for Dunelm Novelty Doorstops presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"cafe1ece-a289-40b4-b998-242296b5506a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-28T10:17:20+01:00","id":"cafe1ece-a289-40b4-b998-242296b5506a","title":"Link to product images and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-28T10:17:20+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a180820050971fbebf3bb78/2603-0019-product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Dunelm Novelty Doorstops</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk to health as the sand inside the doorstops may be contaminated with a quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Dunelm.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Ornaments (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand </td>\n      <td>Dunelm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period</td>\n      <td>January 2019 to February 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Multiple models of novelty doorstops (see below).</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_cafe1ece-a289-40b4-b998-242296b5506a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a180820050971fbebf3bb78/2603-0019-product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops.pdf\">Link to product images and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"product-identifiers\">Product Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Barcode</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Article</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Albert Dog Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5054077316156</td>\n      <td>30198710</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Churchgate Swithland Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851419299</td>\n      <td>31000949</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Cockapoo Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003483060</td>\n      <td>30891356</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Cow Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003880548</td>\n      <td>30966707</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Darcy Duck Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851464251</td>\n      <td>31011438</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Elements Cord Ball Doorstop - Navy</td>\n      <td>5063003483077</td>\n      <td>30891357</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Elements Cord Ball Doorstop - Ochre</td>\n      <td>5063003483305</td>\n      <td>30891370</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Floral Jacquard Doorstop - Black</td>\n      <td>5063003483053</td>\n      <td>30891355</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Floral Jacquard Doorstop - Natural</td>\n      <td>5063003483022</td>\n      <td>30891352</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Fox Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5054077316187</td>\n      <td>30198713</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Frog Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003880296</td>\n      <td>30966669</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Geo Doorstop - Black</td>\n      <td>5063003483268</td>\n      <td>30891366</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Geo Doorstop - Natural</td>\n      <td>5063003483084</td>\n      <td>30891358</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Gilly the Giraffe Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851419404</td>\n      <td>31000940</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Giraffe Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5057722706111</td>\n      <td>30725675</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Hamish the Highland Cow Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5057722706128</td>\n      <td>30725676</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Hare Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003483213</td>\n      <td>30891361</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Hedgehog Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003483091</td>\n      <td>30891359</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Honeycomb Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003483046</td>\n      <td>30891354</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>House Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003880180</td>\n      <td>30966712</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Lenny the Labrador Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851417301</td>\n      <td>31000649</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Llama Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5057722038144</td>\n      <td>30607179</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Mushroom Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003880197</td>\n      <td>30966713</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Owl Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003880555</td>\n      <td>30966708</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pear Shaped Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003894712</td>\n      <td>30968990</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pearl the Pig Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851419367</td>\n      <td>31000955</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pom Pom Doorstop - Grey</td>\n      <td>5057722932497</td>\n      <td>30767112</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pom Pom Doorstop – Natural</td>\n      <td>5057722933104</td>\n      <td>30767113</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pug Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003483237</td>\n      <td>30891363</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Ralph the Schnauzer Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5054077870788</td>\n      <td>30453133</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sam the Sausage Dog Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851419411</td>\n      <td>31000961</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sandy the Boucle Sausage Dog Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851419183</td>\n      <td>31000928</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Stevie the Schnauzer Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5056851419374</td>\n      <td>31000956</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Velvet Cylinder Doorstop – Emerald</td>\n      <td>5057722932480</td>\n      <td>30767111</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Velvet Cylinder Doorstop – Grey</td>\n      <td>5057722932473</td>\n      <td>30767050</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk to health as the sand inside the doorstop may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.  </p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Dunelm. We recommend owners stop using the products immediately and keep them out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the products. </p>\n\n<p>For further information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.dunelm.com/info/help/product-safety-recalls\">https://www.dunelm.com/info/help/product-safety-recalls</a> or contact Dunelm via the Live Chat on the “contact us” page and 0333 234 0870.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately. </li>\n  <li>If the product is undamaged, place it in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children. </li>\n  <li>If the product is damaged and the sand inside is accessible, gather the sand using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths, and double tape it securely. </li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been spilt until the area has been cleaned. </li>\n  <li>Return the product to Dunelm, who will provide a full refund. If you are unable to return the product to Dunelm, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact Dunelm or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">OPSS page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2603-0019</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-07T13:00:29Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"product-identifiers","level":3,"text":"Product Identifiers"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-07","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-07T14:00:29+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops-2603-0019","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops-2603-0019","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops-2603-0019","content_id":"4b59e9b4-cfe1-4b4f-92f7-92ac1eebd937",